Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: xyz project <tomaz.stih@wischner.co.uk>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Description: x compiler suite for z80
 xcc, xas, xopt, xar, xld, xobjcopy, xprog, xgdb, xemu, compiler runtime
 libraries, staged headers, static helper libraries, target CRTs/linker
 scripts, and documentation. Includes CP/M 3, Amstrad CPC 464/664/6128,
 and ZX Spectrum 48K platform payloads plus TAP/TZX/CDT/DSK media creation.
 The package installs the suite under @INSTALL_PREFIX@ and exposes
 @INSTALL_PREFIX@/bin through @PROFILE_SCRIPT@ for new login shells.
